if u dont have python, u gotta install it.
https://www.python.org/downloads/

then once its installed copy the directory of the downloaded file.
open cmd (command prompt) then type in, "cd (PASTE UR DIRECTORY FOR THE FILE HERE)" then enter
it should look something like this
C:\Users\YOURUSERNAME\Downloads> (mine is saved in downloads but it should show the directory u copied)
then type "py (THEFILENAMEHERE).py" so for this file it would look like "py antirecoil-kbmGUI.py"
then if it says to install any dependecies then install the dependecies
and it should work :)


